# OpenAI model for this project's local + agent inference (read by openai-proxy/proxy.mjs).
# The API key stays in ~/.dbeaver-ai-complete; only the model choice lives here.
# Precedence: OPENAI_MODEL env var > this file > ~/.dbeaver-ai-complete > default (gpt-4.1).
#
# gpt-5.4 chosen as the best coding model that fully works through the Chat
# Completions proxy: newest generation that still supports function tools +
# temperature and stays fast (~1.5s). The codex line (gpt-5.3-codex) is OpenAI's
# SOTA for coding but requires the Responses API, which this proxy doesn't speak.
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.4
